  m_text: "In this task, numbered and alphabet targets are situated in walls. Do
    not press start button before all markers on the walls are scanned.\n\nYou should
    shoot the targets in the ascending order as quickly as poossible, while alternating
    numbers and alphabets(1-A-2-B-3-C...).  Hit targets turn green, and the latest
    hit target turns yellow.\n\nPlease fix your starting position and head direction
    as instructed. During the task, you may freely move your entire body\u2014including
    your head, feet, and every part\u2014in any direction.\n\nIgnore the red dot
    appearing for a few seconds at the beginning of the task."
