  m_text: "In this task, numbered targets are situated in walls.  Do not press start
    button before all markers on the walls are scanned. \n\nYou should shoot numbered
    targets in the ascending order from 1 to 25(1-2-3-...) as quickly as poossible.
    Hit targets turn green, and the latest hit target turns yellow.\n\nPlease fix
    your starting position and head direction as instructed. During the task, you
    may freely move your entire body\u2014including your head, feet, and every part\u2014in
    any direction.\n\nIgnore the red dot appearing for a few seconds at the beginning
    of the task."
