  m_text: "In this task, numbered targets and additional objects in the air. You
    should shoot numbered targets in the ascending order from 1 to 25(1-2-3-...)
    as quickly as poossible. \n\nHit targets turn green, and the latest hit target
    turns yellow.\n\nPlease fix your starting position and head direction as instructed.
    During the task, you may freely move your entire body\u2014including your head,
    feet, and every part\u2014in any direction.\n\nIgnore the red dot appearing for
    a few seconds at the beginning of the task."
