    \n\nHit targets turn green, and the latest hit target turns yellow.\n\nPlease
    fix your starting position and head direction as instructed. During the task,
    you may freely move your entire body\u2014including your head, feet, and every
    part\u2014in any direction.\n\nIgnore the red dot appearing for a few seconds
    at the beginning of the task."
